UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So it turns out they should be in diamonds and we should be in clubs. -100 will probably be slightly below average but not terrible. However, 95% of the time, a takeout double over 1@S shows 4 hearts.|
PG| ***** 18 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BWest: ^*NWhat should I have bid.|
PG| ***** 19 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|You have no perfect bid. Pass, 1N, and double are all reasonable choices, though, all are flawed. I think double was The Least of All Possible Flawed.|
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


