mb|2D|mb|P|mb|2S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West has 2 choices. Either bid 3@D directly or 2@S which on this auction is a cue bid showing 10+ with 3+ diamonds. Here is a case where a cue bid shows a limit raise because West is responding to a bid, and did not open.|
