nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|As to why North bid 1N. We play 2/1 game forcing meaning that 2@H by North would be game forcing. However, North is not close to a game forcing hand. Even if playing 2@H shows 10+ I would probably not bid 2@H.|
