UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Probably the best line is to try and ruff several hearts. So ruff a heart at trick 2. Lead a spade to the ace, ruff a heart. Lead a club to the ace, and ruff another heart. And then duck a club and hope you can get another heart ruff which might get you 2 black aces, 4 heart ruffs, and 3 diamonds in dummy for 9 tricks.|
PG| ***** 70 ***** |


