nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Next is an example of how opener or overcaller makes a raise by simply raise the suit. The level you raise to shows you how strong your hand is. In this bidding 2@S shows a simple opener and 3@S shows at least 16.|
